	<item>
		<title>WWE Raw Results &#8211; 11/16/26 (John Cena to appear, WarGames Advantage Tag Team Match)</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-raw-results/397741-live-wwe-raw-results-november-16-2026-raleigh/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-raw-results/397741-live-wwe-raw-results-november-16-2026-raleigh/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Mike Tedesco]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:15:27 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE RAW Results]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[2026]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[live results]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[North Carolina]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[November 16]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Raleigh]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397741</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>WWE Raw ResultsNovember 16, 2026Raleigh, North Carolina (Bon Secours Wellness Arena)Commentary: Joe Tessitore and Wade BarrettResults by: Mike&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-raw-results/397741-live-wwe-raw-results-november-16-2026-raleigh/">WWE Raw Results &#8211; 11/16/26 (John Cena to appear, WarGames Advantage Tag Team Match)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<figure class="wp-block-image is-resized"><img decoding="async" width="207" height="112" src="https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/image-21.png" alt="" class="wp-image-375213" style="aspect-ratio:1.8482142857142858;width:207px;height:auto"/></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>WWE Raw Results<br>November 16, 2026<br>Raleigh, North Carolina (Bon Secours Wellness Arena)<br>Commentary: Joe Tessitore and Wade Barrett<br>Results by: Mike Tedesco of Wrestleview.com</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">&#8220;Then. Now. Forever. Together.&#8221; The WWE video leads us into the show.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We&#8217;re only 12 days away from Survivor Series. John Cena will be live on Raw tonight to talk about the John Cena Classic. The Judgment Day, IYO SKY, and Stephanie Vaquer are shown arriving.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Parking Garage Segment</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A black SUV drives into the parking garage, and The Bloodline, minus Roman Reigns, exits. Raw General Manager Adam Pearce, flanked by two security guards, comes up and says he knows Jacob Fatu wants a piece of 946. If anyone other than Cruz Montana, Carmelo Hayes, or The Usos gets involved in the match tonight, the advantage goes to the other team. Pearce says that if they want the 946, they should win the WarGames Advantage Match and WarGames. Fatu isn&#8217;t happy.</p>



<h3 id="the-next-member-of-team-usa-is-announced" class="wp-block-heading">The next member of Team USA is announced</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">&#8220;Wrestling has more than one royal family.&#8221;</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>&#8220;The American Nightmare&#8221; Cody Rhodes</strong> heads to the ring to a big ovation. Rhodes greets Raleigh, North Carolina, and asks what they want to talk about. Rhodes says at Survivor Series, Team Mexico, led by WWE Hall of Famer Rey Mysterio, will take on Team USA. A &#8220;USA&#8221; chant fires up. Rhodes says he&#8217;s lucky to be the captain of Team USA. Rhodes wants to announce the team&#8217;s fourth member.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>CM Punk</strong>, who is already on Team USA, heads to the ring. Rhodes looks surprised to see him. Rhodes says we&#8217;re 10 minutes into the show and surprises always happen. What is Punk doing here? Punk says he wanted to ask the people if it&#8217;s good to be alive on a Monday night in Raleigh or what? The crowd cheers. Punk says he knows he should have let Rhodes know, but he wanted to stand next to Rhodes as Co-Captain as they announce the fourth member of Team USA. Rhodes is confused about the Co-Captain title and says he&#8217;s the captain. Punk sounds like he has a cold and asks what&#8217;s better than one captain.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>The Miz</strong> heads to the ring with <strong>Kit Wilson</strong>. Miz mentions that he, Punk, and Rhodes all debuted close to each other. 20 years later, who is still fighting at their level? Imagine what they can do together. Miz wants to be the fourth member of Team USA. Punk whispers to Rhodes, and they look around. The crowd is mixed. Punk says they&#8217;ve already chosen somebody else. Miz is not happy. Rhodes asks, &#8220;<em>We</em> have?&#8221; Rhodes asks if Miz has anything else to say. Miz says when he steps into a WWE ring, there is no one better than him. Miz is better than Rhodes and Punk, as well as everyone in the arena. Miz is the best the WWE has to offer. Miz shouts that he deserves this. Half the crowd agrees with him. Punk mentions that Miz dressed up as the Calgary Kid once, which disqualifies him from being on Team USA.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Rhodes asks Punk why he keeps saying &#8220;we picked.&#8221; Does Punk know who Rhodes picked? Punk sounds uncertain as he says, &#8220;Yeah.&#8221;</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>LA Knight</strong> heads to the ring to a great ovation. Knight gets in the ring, but Miz interrupts him. Miz is furious. Miz mentions that he&#8217;s the first two-time Grand Slam winner. You want a real American? Miz hosts American Gladiators. Miz has starred in several Marine movies. He&#8217;s got a hot, sexy wife and is the epitome of the American Dream. You can just call him &#8220;Hacksaw&#8221; Mike Mizaanin. Knight tells Miz to calm down and talks with Rhodes and Punk. Knight says Miz made a lot of points. Knight mentions that Miz&#8217;s DVDs sold less than any DVD ever. Knight won&#8217;t give Miz his flowers; he&#8217;ll let Miz take them. Knight disrobes, wearing his wrestling trunks. Knight says he&#8217;ll let Miz fight him for the spot. Miz looks disgusted.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Referee Danilo Anfibio runs down for this match.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Commercial Break-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Cody Rhodes and CM Punk are on commentary for this match. The winner will join Team USA.</p>



<h3 id="the-miz-w-kit-wilson-vs-la-knight" class="wp-block-heading">The Miz w/ Kit Wilson vs. LA Knight</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Referee:</strong> Danilo Anfibio</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We join this match in progress. Miz boots Knight back and charges, but Knight hits a snap powerslam for a two-count. Miz tries to fight back, but Knight hits a neckbreaker for a two-count. Knight stomps Miz in the corner, so Miz goes to the apron and snaps him off the top rope. Miz goes for a roll-up, but Knight sits on his shoulders. Miz pulls him down for a two-count. Knight quickly hits a clothesline. Knight shoulders Miz in the midsection before having a whip reversed on him. Miz distracts the referee, and Wilson grabs Knight. Miz attacks Knight from behind and stomps him. Miz picks up a two-count. Miz shouts to Rhodes and Punk. Miz starts impersonating Dusty Rhodes with the stinging jabs. Miz goes for a Bionic Elbow, but Knight blocks it and sends Miz over the top rope. Knight then crushes Miz with a baseball slide. Knight scares Wilson away and bounces Miz&#8217;s face off the commentary table. Knight sends Miz into the ring, and the referee checks on him. Wilson then sends Knight headfirst into the ring post.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Commercial Break-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em>Refresh for the latest results.</em></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-raw-results/397741-live-wwe-raw-results-november-16-2026-raleigh/">WWE Raw Results &#8211; 11/16/26 (John Cena to appear, WarGames Advantage Tag Team Match)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-raw-results/397741-live-wwe-raw-results-november-16-2026-raleigh/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>WWE reportedly planning major expansion in Orlando</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397738-wwe-reportedly-planning-major-expansion-in-orlando/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397738-wwe-reportedly-planning-major-expansion-in-orlando/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:42:23 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NXT]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Orlando]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[training]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397738</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Orlando Business Journal has reported that WWE is working toward receiving city incentives worth $7 million in conjunction&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397738-wwe-reportedly-planning-major-expansion-in-orlando/">WWE reportedly planning major expansion in Orlando</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://www.bizjournals.com/orlando/news/2026/11/16/wwe-wrestling-ufc-hq-city-soccer-cra-incentives.html">Orlando Business Journal</a> has reported that WWE is working toward receiving city incentives worth $7 million in conjunction with creating a new 98,000 square foot building serving as &#8220;a regional headquarters and training for NXT operations.&#8221;</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The new building, which could bring 50 jobs to the city upon opening, would be the newest addition to the company&#8217;s work on the developmental brand in the area following the opening of the Performance Center in nearby Winter Park in July 2013.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Source: <a href="https://pwinsider.com/article/213749/wwe-planning-big-orlando-expansion.html?p=1">PWInsider</a></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397738-wwe-reportedly-planning-major-expansion-in-orlando/">WWE reportedly planning major expansion in Orlando</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397738-wwe-reportedly-planning-major-expansion-in-orlando/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>AEW talent claims to fight off mother bear before Full Gear</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397735-aew-talent-claims-to-fight-off-mother-bear-before-full-gear/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397735-aew-talent-claims-to-fight-off-mother-bear-before-full-gear/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:19:45 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[AEW News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Adam Copeland]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AEW]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Full Gear]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397735</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Bryan Alvarez of F4WOnline has relayed a story shared by Adam Copeland, who revealed he fought off a&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397735-aew-talent-claims-to-fight-off-mother-bear-before-full-gear/">AEW talent claims to fight off mother bear before Full Gear</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Bryan Alvarez of <a href="https://www.f4wonline.com/news/aew/subscribers-only-aew-star-successfully-fought-off-a-bear-last-week/">F4WOnline</a> has relayed a story shared by Adam Copeland, who revealed he fought off a mother bear in the days leading up to Full Gear.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Copeland, who went on to face Kazuchika Okada at the pay-per-view for the AEW International Championship, explained that he heard a noise off to the side while walking his dogs, discovering a mother bear accompanied by her cubs approaching him.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">He considered raising his arms per the recommended response of making oneself appear as large as possible when confronted by a bear, but with both hands occupied with his dogs&#8217; leashes he could not.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Copeland claims that the bear further approaching him led to a split-second decision, ultimately kicking the animal with his shin directly underneath the jaw.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The former TNT Champion says this was enough to convince the mother bear to retreat with her cubs, allowing Copeland and his dogs to escape the situation safely.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Despite avoiding further danger, Copeland reportedly told people afterward that his shin was extremely sore from the impact.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">His match at Full Gear was followed by a backstage segment with Mick Foley, claiming he had gotten some answers he wanted from the bout and his failure to win the title from the Rainmaker.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<iframe title="Adam Copeland gets HONEST with Mick Foley | AEW Full Gear 2026" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/GE5GBsnL8SQ?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div></figure>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397735-aew-talent-claims-to-fight-off-mother-bear-before-full-gear/">AEW talent claims to fight off mother bear before Full Gear</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397735-aew-talent-claims-to-fight-off-mother-bear-before-full-gear/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>ECW legend coming out of retirement for another match</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397728-ecw-legend-coming-out-of-retirement-for-another-match/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397728-ecw-legend-coming-out-of-retirement-for-another-match/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 19:59:20 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Misc. News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Australia]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Battle Championship Wrestling]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[out of retirement]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[The Sandman]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397728</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Almost eight months after his retirement match against The Invisible Man at Joey Janela&#8217;s Spring Break event for&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397728-ecw-legend-coming-out-of-retirement-for-another-match/">ECW legend coming out of retirement for another match</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Almost eight months after his retirement match against The Invisible Man at Joey Janela&#8217;s Spring Break event for GCW this past April, ECW legend The Sandman has been announced for Battle Championship Wrestling&#8217;s BCW 74: 10th Anniversary show at the Whitehorse Club in Burwood East Vic on Friday night December 4. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The 63-year old Sandman is set to take on DCT.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">According to <a href="https://www.f4wonline.com/news/indies/ecw-legend-the-sandman-coming-out-of-retirement/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">F4WOnline</a>, DCT (David Campbell Thomson) is a Scottish wrestler who retired for ICW in 2023, but resumed his career in Australia last year. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">***BCW 74: 10th ANNIVERSARY SHOW MATCH ANNOUNCEMENT***<br><br>Our third official match announcement for BATTLE CHAMPIONSHIP WRESTLING 74: 10th ANNIVERSARY SHOW features five-time ECW WORLD HEAVYWEIGHT CHAMPION THE SANDMAN VS the one-time ICW HEAVYWEIGHT CHAMPION of Scotland &#8211; DCT!<br><br>At… <a href="https://t.co/QaGdtrS37V">pic.twitter.com/QaGdtrS37V</a></p>&mdash; BCW Pro Wrestling (@BCWBattleChamp) <a href="https://x.com/BCWBattleChamp/status/2122260399492055099?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 16, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Sandman has appeared on screen at the end of BCW 73, confirming his appearance for the December 4 show.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"> </p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">***THE SANDMAN IS COMING TO BCW 74***<br><br>At the end of BCW 73 THE SANDMAN appeared on screen to confirm his presence at BCW 74 and made it very clear he&#39;s coming to the Battle Kingdom to kick some ass and drink some beer!<br>&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;-… <a href="https://t.co/ItLgapqNed">pic.twitter.com/ItLgapqNed</a></p>&mdash; BCW Pro Wrestling (@BCWBattleChamp) <a href="https://x.com/BCWBattleChamp/status/2119696375659344028?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 9, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Per a previous report from the <a href="https://heraldsun.com.au/leader/east/whitehorse-ratepayers-could-foot-98k-bill-to-pay-off-community-clubs-loan/news-story/e765f5346b5baabda41b0c834eb03078" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Herald Sun</a>, the venue is scheduled to be demolished next year, after the Whitehorse City Council voted to terminate the club&#8217;s lease at East Burwood Reserve due to plummeting membership and financial struggles, including paying off a remaining $98,000 bank loan. The site is slated for redevelopment into carparking and sports infrastructure under the East Burwood Reserve Masterplan.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397728-ecw-legend-coming-out-of-retirement-for-another-match/">ECW legend coming out of retirement for another match</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397728-ecw-legend-coming-out-of-retirement-for-another-match/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>UPDATED: TNA Wrestling Radio revealed in partnership with iHeartRadio</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/397699-tna-wrestling-radio-revealed-in-partnership-with-iheartradio/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/397699-tna-wrestling-radio-revealed-in-partnership-with-iheartradio/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 19:15:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Impact News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact Wrestling News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[iHeartRadio]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[TNA]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[TNA Wrestling Radio]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397699</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>-Updated 11/16 @ 2:15 pm ET- TNA has revealed more details regarding TNA Wrestling Radio in the following&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/397699-tna-wrestling-radio-revealed-in-partnership-with-iheartradio/">UPDATED: TNA Wrestling Radio revealed in partnership with iHeartRadio</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Updated 11/16 @ 2:15 pm ET-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">TNA has revealed more details regarding TNA Wrestling Radio in the following announcement:</p>



<h1 id="coming-soon-tna-wrestling-radio-only-on-iheartradio" class="wp-block-heading">Coming Soon: TNA Wrestling Radio, Only on iHeartRadio</h1>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Nov 16, 2026 |TNA Wrestling Staff</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">TNA Wrestling and iHeartRadio announced today a new collaboration to launch the first-ever TNA Wrestling Radio station, set to stream exclusively on <a href="https://www.iheart.com/">iHeartRadio</a> and the iHeartRadio app. The news was first revealed Sunday on the live Destination X pay-per-view. This announcement expands upon the <a href="https://www.iheartmedia.com/press/tna-wrestling-and-iheartmedia-announce-major-multi-platform-collaboration">multi-platform deal</a> TNA Wrestling and iHeartMedia rolled out earlier this year.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">TNA Wrestling Radio will be available with iHeartRadio starting later this year as a dedicated digital audio channel, featuring archived TNA content, including past pay-per-views, memorable matches and unforgettable interviews.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">TNA Wrestling Radio will spotlight TNA’s 20-year library of classic matches, historic moments, interviews, memorable rivalries and behind-the-scenes content. TNA Wrestling Radio will expand its offerings in the upcoming year to include original TNA podcasts, celebrity-driven shows, exclusive interviews, plus additional wrestling and entertainment programming beyond TNA.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">“<em>We are excited to expand our wide-ranging partnership with iHeartRadio as another way for fans to connect with their favorite wrestlers, revisit iconic moments and engage with TNA beyond the flagship weekly TV show,</em>” said TNA Wrestling President Carlos Silva.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">“<em>Since announcing our broader multi-platform collaboration with TNA Wrestling earlier this year, we’ve been working together to identify new ways for fans to connect with the brand and its biggest personalities across audio – ‘TNA Wrestling Radio’ represents that next step together,</em>” said Michael Biondo, President of Business Development and Strategic Partnerships for iHeartMedia. “<em>By combining TNA’s rich library of iconic matches, memorable moments and legendary rivalries with iHeartRadio’s scale and distribution, we’re creating a dedicated destination where fans can engage in new ways.</em>”</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The TNA-iHeartRadio partnership will further expand TNA’s reach beyond Thursday Night iMPACT! on AMC, live events and existing digital platforms.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">TNA and iHeart will announce the new podcasts and hosts in the coming weeks, including one dedicated to the popular Knockouts Division.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">****</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Original Report 11/15 @ 7:08 pm ET-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">During the Countdown to Destination X preshow, Elias announced that TNA has partnered with iHeartRadio to present TNA Wrestling Radio, presenting 24/7 content from the promotion.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">.<a href="https://x.com/_Iam_Elijah_?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@_Iam_Elijah_</a> announced that TNA has partnered with <a href="https://x.com/iHeartRadio?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@iHeartRadio</a> to present TNA Wrestling Radio! <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/TNADestinationX?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#TNADestinationX</a> <a href="https://t.co/cuKXEdaiec">pic.twitter.com/cuKXEdaiec</a></p>&mdash; TNA Wrestling (@ThisIsTNA) <a href="https://x.com/ThisIsTNA/status/2122097855255191589?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 15, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Tom Hannifan added details on the upcoming station, noting the service will include full access to the TNA library along with original podcasts.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/397699-tna-wrestling-radio-revealed-in-partnership-with-iheartradio/">UPDATED: TNA Wrestling Radio revealed in partnership with iHeartRadio</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/397699-tna-wrestling-radio-revealed-in-partnership-with-iheartradio/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>AEW announces three-week residency at Arlington Expo Center</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397720-aew-announces-three-week-residency-at-arlington-expo-center/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397720-aew-announces-three-week-residency-at-arlington-expo-center/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:30:20 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[AEW News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AEW]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Arlington]]></category>
