		<category><![CDATA[January]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Texas]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397720</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>As first reported by The Dallas Morning News, then confirmed by AEW, the promotion is set for three&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397720-aew-announces-three-week-residency-at-arlington-expo-center/">AEW announces three-week residency at Arlington Expo Center</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">As first reported by <a href="https://www.dallasnews.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">The Dallas Morning News</a>, then <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2122359486287344016" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">confirmed by AEW</a>, the promotion is set for three weeks of action at the Arlington Expo Center this January.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">AEW returns to the venue for three live episodes of Collision on January 9, 16 and 23.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397720-aew-announces-three-week-residency-at-arlington-expo-center/">AEW announces three-week residency at Arlington Expo Center</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
