		<item>
		<title>Report: Some in WWE &#8216;skeptical&#8217; of long-term AEW deal</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397708-report-some-in-wwe-skeptical-of-long-term-aew-deal/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397708-report-some-in-wwe-skeptical-of-long-term-aew-deal/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:40:44 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[AEW News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AEW]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[CMLL]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Full Gear]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Persephone]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Tony Khan]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397708</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>A new report from Bryan Alvarez of F4WOnline has provided an update on WWE&#8217;s reaction to news of&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397708-report-some-in-wwe-skeptical-of-long-term-aew-deal/">Report: Some in WWE &#8216;skeptical&#8217; of long-term AEW deal</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A new report from Bryan Alvarez of F4WOnline has provided an update on WWE&#8217;s reaction to news of Persephone being under a long-term contract with AEW and CMLL.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Following remarks from Tony Khan after Full Gear that the reigning CMLL World Women&#8217;s Champion is under contract &#8220;for many years to come,&#8221; Alvarez noted:</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Regarding Persephone, around midsummer WWE felt she was going to stick around CMLL/AEW solely based on how often Tony started to book her. Some in WWE are skeptical she is signed for “many years”, but regardless their push to get one or two additions to the WWE/NXT/AAA women’s division by a bi-lingual female is underway.</p>
</blockquote>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Persephone&#8217;s run in AEW has already seen success in the form of a run as TBS Champion, even competing to regain the title at the Full Gear Tailgate Brawl preshow.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In CMLL, she has competed as recently as November 10 in trios action at a show in Arena Mexico.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397708-report-some-in-wwe-skeptical-of-long-term-aew-deal/">Report: Some in WWE &#8216;skeptical&#8217; of long-term AEW deal</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397708-report-some-in-wwe-skeptical-of-long-term-aew-deal/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
