		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-results/397705-tna-destination-x-quick-results-11-15-26/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-results/397705-tna-destination-x-quick-results-11-15-26/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:22:55 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Impact Results]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact Wrestling Results]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[11/15/26 TNA Destination X Quick Results]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Destination X]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Edmonton EXPO Centre]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[TNA]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397705</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Below are the quick results from Sunday&#8217;s TNA Destination X pay-per-view, which took place from the Edmonton EXPO&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-results/397705-tna-destination-x-quick-results-11-15-26/">TNA Destination X Quick Results &#8211; 11/15/26</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Below are the quick results from Sunday&#8217;s TNA Destination X pay-per-view, which took place from the Edmonton EXPO Centre in Edmonton, Alberta, Canada.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">&#8211;<strong>Tasha Steelz won the Knockouts Ultimate X, to become the number one contender to the TNA Knockouts championship.</strong> Other participants included Kiera Hogan, Shayna Baszler, Shotzi Blackheart, Heather by Elegance and M By Elegance.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">&#8211;<strong>Matt Hardy defeated Joseph Sawyer in a no disqualification match</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">&#8211;<strong>Ricky Sosa defeated Jason Hotch, Fabian Aichner, Home Town Man and Amir Jordan to become the first World X Cup Winner since 2008</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>-Mustafa Ali vs. Frankie Kazarian ended in a no contest</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">&#8211;<strong>Ultimate X Match to earn a shot at the title: KC Navarro defeated Joe Alonzo, Cedric Alexander, John Skyler, AJ Francis and TJP</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>-Leon defeated Trey Miguel to retain the TNA World Championship</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The countdown show featured Elijah defeated Vincent of The Righteous.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<iframe title="Knockouts Ultimate X RETURNS in High Wire Spectacle | TNA Destination X 2026 Highlights" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/yILHx7WdDZQ?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<iframe loading="lazy" title="International Champion PINNED in INCREDIBLE World X-Cup Match | TNA Destination X 2026 Highlights" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/_sobqPJn-Ls?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div></figure>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-results/397705-tna-destination-x-quick-results-11-15-26/">TNA Destination X Quick Results &#8211; 11/15/26</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-results/397705-tna-destination-x-quick-results-11-15-26/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
